<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Bagi maksud seksyen ini, “Entiti Kerajaan” ertinya—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_6__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_6> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@> .
