<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_6__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "mana-mana pihak berkuasa tempatan. Kewajipan am pemberi perkhidmatan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@> .
