<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_b__subpara_i> <https://schema.org/text> "bahawa kesalahan itu telah dilakukan tanpa pengetahuannya; atau"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_b__subpara_ii> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_b> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@> .
