<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@/~part_VI__cl_25> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@/~part_VI> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/msa@> .
